# Secrets & runtime data — never tracked. See the credential remediation
# plan: these used to be committed (a real Firebase/GCP service account key,
# a live Gemini API key inside data_store.json, and password hashes/session
# tokens in auth.db). Untracked going forward with `git rm --cached`; the
# files themselves stay on disk and the app keeps reading/writing them
# exactly as before.
